@MediQueue.Appointment.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

GET {{MediQueue.Appointment.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{MediQueue.Appointment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Bệnh nhân minh họa",
