}

###

POST {{MediQueue.Appointment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient.example@example.test",
  "password": "<mat-khau-khong-luu-vao-git>"
}

###

GET {{MediQueue.Appointment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/account/me
